ay:none!important}}</style><div class=\"side-box side-box-right plainlinks sistersitebox\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173195\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style>\n<div class=\"side-box-flex\">\n<div class=\"side-box-image\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wiktionary-logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Wiktionary-logo.svg/40px-Wiktionary-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Wiktionary-logo.svg/120px-Wiktionary-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"370\" data-file-height=\"350\" /></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"side-box-text plainlist\">查看<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E8%AF%8D%E5%85%B8\" title=\"維基詞典\">維基詞典</a>中的詞條「<b><a href=\"https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/Special:Search/%E9%BA%A6%E8%8A%BD\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikt:Special:Search/麦芽\">麦芽</a></b>」。</div></div>\n</div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20091113212213/http://www.tcm100.com/userReg/JiaoCai/ZhongYaoXue/zzZhongYao227.htm\">作為中藥的麥芽</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20090323083600/http://byo.com/stories/article/indices/44-malt/1097-make-your-own-malt\">自己製作麥芽</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ukmalt.com\">英國麥芽</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210427080403/http://www.ukmalt.com/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8